Kuzpkg 0.1.0-alpha
==================

Initial release of Kuzpkg.

Kuzpkg is a fork of Pacman 7.1.0, the package manager originally
developed by the Arch Linux project.

This release begins the Kuzpkg project under its new name and version.

Upstream:
https://gitlab.archlinux.org/kuzpkg/kuzpkg

Forked from:
Pacman 7.1.0

Release: 0.1.0-alpha
